contentText:
The Spice Girls , but make it pumpkin. In a hilarious new commercial for Dunkin&#8217;, Ginger Spice and Baby Spice reunite to help usher in the brand&#8217;s fall flavors while revealing that there&#8217;s a band member fans don&#8217;t know about, played by Rachel Dratch.

